<title>UK: UK's Jacobs Holdings to buy rest of Ropner.</title>
<headline>UK's Jacobs Holdings to buy rest of Ropner.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping company Jacobs Holdings Plc said it agreed to buy the rest of Britain's Ropner Plc in a recommended offer of 143.9p per Ropner share, payable in cash and stock.</p>
<p>The offer, which valued Ropner's issued ordinary share capital at about 33.7 million stg, comprised three new Jacobs shares and 302.75p in cash for every four Ropner shares.</p>
</text>
